OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers challenge council plan
OL,4,Ato demolish homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers trying to prevent their homes
OL,7,Ffrom being demolished have been granted
OL,8,Fpermission for a judicial review into a
OL,9,Fcouncil's regeneration plans.
OL,11,FIn December 2025, Durham County
OL,12,FCouncil's #10.7m project to demolish
OL,13,Fhouses on three of Horden's numbered
OL,14,Fstreets and build 100 new ones was
OL,15,Fgranted planning permission.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
