OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers challenge council plan
OL,4,Ato demolish homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents opposed to the demolition
OL,7,Fmanaged to raise enough funding to
OL,8,Fchallenge the plans and a High Court
OL,9,Fjudge has now granted permission for
OL,10,Fthe case to proceed to a substantive
OL,11,Fhearing, where the court will decide
OL,12,Fwhether to quash the plans.
OL,14,FThe Reform UK-led council said its
OL,15,Fplans would "improve quality of life
OL,16,Ffor local people by ensuring a higher
OL,17,Fstandard of housing".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
